      "summary": "Blanched broccolini tossed in garlic-infused olive oil and finished with salt and lemon zest.",
      "method_md": "# 🥬 Garlicky Broccolini Side\n## Ingredients\n- 2 bunches broccolini\n- 1½–2 tbsp olive oil\n- 1 garlic clove, thinly sliced\n- Pinch fine salt\n- Tiny pinch lemon zest\n## Method\n1. Blanch broccolini in salted boiling water **90 seconds**.\n2. Drain very well.\n3. Heat olive oil in pan over medium, add garlic 15–20 sec.\n4. Add broccolini, toss **1–2 minutes**.\n5. Finish with salt and lemon zest.",
